      "HintChat": "<details style='margin-bottom:10px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border:1px solid #444; border-radius:4px; padding:5px;'><summary style='cursor:pointer; color:#e61c34; font-weight:bold; padding:5px;'>📖 Trigger Config Guide (Click to expand)</summary><div style='padding:10px; font-size:0.85em; color:#ccc; line-height:1.6; max-height:250px; overflow-y:auto; border-top:1px solid #444;'><p style='margin-top:0;'><b>1. Basic Modes</b><br>• <b>Keyword (Any):</b> Triggers if the word is found in text/flavor.<br>• <b>Keyword (Roll):</b> Triggers only on <b>'Dice Rolls'</b> containing the word.<br>• <b>Dice Check:</b> Inspects specific die values.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;└ <i>Enter <b>#</b>(Index) and <b>Val</b>(Target). (See orange numbers in Inspector)</i></p><p><b>2. Special Mode (Advanced Formula)</b><br>Create complex conditions using JavaScript syntax.<br><br><b>[Operators]</b><br>• <code>==</code> : Equal<br>• <code>!=</code> : Not Equal<br>• <code>&gt;=</code> : Greater or Equal<br>• <code>&&</code> : AND (Both true)<br>• <code>||</code> : OR (Either true)<br><br><b>[Variables]</b><br>• <code>d</code> : Array of die results (e.g. <code>d[0]</code> is the 1st die)<br>• <code>t</code> : Total sum of the roll<br>• <code>flavor</code> : Item name or chat text<br><br><b>[Examples]</b><br>• <b>Fabula Ultima Critical:</b><br><code style='background:#222; padding:2px 5px; color:#4ecdc4'>d[0] == d[1] && d[0] >= 6</code><br>• <b>High-Roll Doubles (Double & Total >= 12):</b><br><code style='background:#222; padding:2px 5px; color:#f9ca24'>d[0] == d[1] && t >= 12</code></div><br><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Right-click a chat message and select <b>'⚡ Cinematic Inspector'</b> to check die indices.</details>",
